define-notes (direct extract):
Mission: protecting all 12 native felid species of China, which includes:
1. evaluating the current conservation status of felid species, identifying their key habitats;
2. providing local support to key habitats;
3. engaging the public to felid conservation, fundraising, and raising awareness of conserving biodiversity

